From 8c3ed28335b8973ca167664e2e26b1d9b3b88009 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:35:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Give the setup generator labelled outfits and check the
 outfit ids it returns

Each published outfit now reaches the setup generator as "id: name (role; outfit;
formality)" from its public catalogue rows, so it can match clothes to the
character's role. It also returns up to three more outfit ids for a "Suggested"
row in the Studio. Every returned outfit id is checked against the chosen
gender's published list; an unknown id is logged and dropped, never swapped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
